{
  "_comment": "Generated from data/case_tables dialogue CSV.",
  "start": "hub",
  "nodes": {
    "hub": {
      "text": "公子找小的？小的叫阿贵，跟周老爷跑腿。您要问路，老爷和船家都比小的清楚。",
      "emotion": "nervous",
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "跟周老爷多久了？",
          "goto": "ask_master",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "这么晚赶路安全吗？",
          "goto": "ask_voyage",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "你水性怎么样？",
          "goto": "ask_feelings",
          "type": "ask",
          "requires": [
            {
              "not_flag": "cabin_explore_done"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_master": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "跟周老爷相识多久了？看你们……挺熟。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "……十二年。十二年了，小的十六岁进周家。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他回答得太快了。而且说了两遍。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "先在铺里扫地，后来……后来才跟着跑腿。老爷对小的……不薄。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "十二年不短。他平时都差你做什么？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "倒茶、搬货、守夜……看箱子。账册和银子老爷自己拿，小的只管手脚利索。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他在划清界限。为什么？）那今晚这些箱子，也是你来守？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "是。老爷说……\"守着红箱，别磕着碰着，也别多问。\"",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "defensive"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_voyage": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "外头雨这么大……赶夜路稳当吗？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "小的也觉得……不踏实。可老爷说货急，老范又说这趟能走……小的拦不住。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他把\"拦不住\"放在最后。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "老范说能走？东汊那边没事？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "老范说……东汊近，水涨了反倒省路。老爷听了，就让小的们把箱子搬上船。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "你自己心里怎么想？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "……都担心。雨打得人睁不开眼，东汊又有暗礁……小的不懂船。小的瞎说的。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "shaken"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ask_feelings": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_talked"
      ],
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "你会水吗？我自己也不大行，随口问问。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "不会。……小的不会水。码头边水一深，腿就软，更别说江心了。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他说\"不会\"的时候……不像怕水。像怕被问到这个问题。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "那上船前……有没有多备点东西，防万一？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "准备了。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "包袱底下……塞了个牛皮浮囊。真要落水，至少能抱一抱。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（那个包袱底下鼓起的弧形……原来是这个。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "周老板知道吗？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "casual"
        },
        {
          "text": "不知道。老爷见了会骂小的晦气。小的怕死……只敢偷偷带着。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "shaken"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    },
    "press_bag": {
      "set_flags": [
        "cabin_agui_observed"
      ],
      "gain_clue": "clue_agui_suspicious_bag",
      "lines": [
        {
          "text": "你包袱底下……渗水了？",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "……是上船前淋的雨。包袱放在舱角，船一晃，水就洇进去了。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他刚才扭头的样子……像怕包袱不在原地。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        },
        {
          "text": "这结……系得挺紧。",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "curious"
        },
        {
          "text": "里面就是旧衣裳和浮囊。小的不会水……小的不会水，带个保命东西，不敢让老爷看见。",
          "speaker_id": "agui_cabin",
          "emotion": "nervous"
        },
        {
          "text": "（他今晚第二次说\"不敢让老爷看见\"。第二次说自己不会水。）",
          "speaker_id": "lu_zhao",
          "speaker": "陆昭",
          "emotion": "inner_thought"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "text": "继续聊",
          "goto": "hub"
        },
        {
          "text": "先告辞",
          "goto": "__exit__"
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
